# CR 602.2a: activating an ability from a hidden zone reveals the card that has it - the first step of the activation,
# before its costs are paid (CR 602.2b, 601.2h), so a cost that discards the card shows it first. Barkhide Mauler's cycling
# {2} (CR 702.29a) discards it from the hand as the cost is paid: Bot1 has revealed it once, by the time the ability is on
# the stack and the card is in the graveyard. The cycled card then draws the Forest.

[Bot1 Deck]
Blasted Landscape
Mana Crypt
Barkhide Mauler
Plains x4
Forest
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Blasted Landscape.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mana Crypt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Revealed = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mana Crypt.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Barkhide Mauler.Activate
? Stack = Barkhide Mauler
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Barkhide Mauler
? Bot1.Revealed = Barkhide Mauler
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Revealed = Barkhide Mauler
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains
Bot2.Revealed = (absent)
